    nsBody += "<h2>What happens at the season change</h2><p>Twice a year, on the last Sunday of March and of October, international broadcasters switch schedules. Many move broadcasts by an hour to follow daylight saving time, and some change frequency to suit the season's propagation. A few services start or stop.</p>"
